#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Planning App</b>:</strong> Schedule your creative team's workload "
"visually to prevent burnout and\n"
"        ensure the right talent is assigned to the right project."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>工作規劃應用程式</b></strong>：利用視覺化的方式，為創意團隊分配工"
"作量，防止過勞，\n"
"        同時確保不同專案都獲分配合適的人才去跟進。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Project App</b>:</strong> Plan and execute complex marketing "
"campaigns with task lists, Kanban\n"
"        boards, and milestones to keep your team on deadline.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>專案管理應用程式</b></strong>：制定並執行牽涉範疇繁複的行銷計劃，"
"運用任務清單、看板畫面、\n"
"        里程碑等，確保團隊準時完成各項任務。<br/>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Social Marketing App</b>:</strong> Manage social media campaigns "
"for multiple clients from one\n"
"        central dashboard, scheduling posts and tracking engagement."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>社交媒體推廣應用程式</b></strong>：利用一個集中式的概覽畫面，輕鬆"
"管理不同客戶的社交媒體推廣計劃，\n"
"        包括排定帖文發佈時間、追蹤受眾互動情況等。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Subscriptions App</b>:</strong> Manage recurring revenue streams "
"for retainer clients, automating\n"
"        monthly invoicing and renewal management."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>訂閱應用程式</b></strong>：管理來自長期舊客的經常收入，自動化\n"
"        開立每月發票及管理續約。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Timesheets App</b>:</strong> Track time spent on client projects "
"effortlessly, ensuring accurate\n"
"        billing for hourly work and better resource planning.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>工時管理應用程式</b></strong>：輕鬆追蹤處理客戶專案所花費的工時，"
"確保按工時收費的\n"
"        賬單準確無誤，同時優化資源規劃。<br/>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Website App</b>:</strong> Showcase your agency's portfolio and "
"case studies with a professional,\n"
"        easy-to-update website that attracts new business."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>網站製作應用程式</b></strong>：利用專業、更新容易的網站，展示你公"
"司的作品集及客戶案例，\n"
"        幫助吸引新客戶。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.view_page_home
msgid "<strong>ACCELERATE YOUR BRAND GROWTH WITH HIGH-IMPACT STRATEGY</strong>"
msgstr ""

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting</strong>: Gain complete financial visibility with "
"integrated bookkeeping, financial reporting, and tax management."
msgstr ""
"<strong>會計</strong>：透過整合的簿記功能、財務報告及稅務管理，全面掌握完整財"
"務數據。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Appointment</strong>: Manage appointments synchronised with your "
"calendar in a few clicks with the Appointment App."
msgstr ""
"<strong>預約</strong>：只需輕按幾下，即可使用預約應用程式管理預約詳情，資料會"
"與你的日曆同步。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automate Reporting</strong>: Schedule automated reports for clients "
"showing campaign performance, hours worked, and project progress."
msgstr ""
"<strong>自動化報告</strong>：為客戶預定自動化報告，顯示推廣活動的成效、已花費"
"工時，以及專案進度。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>CRM App</strong>: Track leads and opportunities in a visual "
"pipeline, ensuring you never miss a\n"
"        potential client pitch or follow-up."
msgstr ""
"<strong>客戶關係應用程式</strong>：利用視覺化管道，追蹤潛在客戶及銷售商機，確"
"保不會錯過任何向潛在客戶提案的機會，\n"
"        並妥善跟進後續工作。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Create Service Packages</strong>: Bundle services into packages "
"(like \"Brand Launch\" or \"Digital Presence\") to streamline your sales "
"process and upsell clients."
msgstr ""
"<strong>建立服務套裝</strong>：將不同服務捆綁成套餐（例如「品牌開張」或「數碼"
"可見度」），以簡化你的銷售流程，並向客戶作出追加銷售。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:marketing_agency.sale_order_template_4
msgid "<strong>Deliverables:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>可交付成果：</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Helpdesk</strong>: Provide exceptional client support with ticket "
"tracking, SLAs, and knowledge bases."
msgstr ""
"<strong>幫助台</strong>：透過支援請求追蹤、服務水平協議、知識庫文章等，提供卓"
"越的客戶支援。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:marketing_agency.sale_order_template_4
msgid "<strong>Included in Scope:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>服務範圍包括：</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Integrate Everything</strong>: Link your CRM opportunities to "
"projects, timesheets to invoices, and subscriptions to recurring services "
"for a seamless workflow."
msgstr ""
"<strong>整合所有資訊</strong>：你可將銷售機會連結至專案，將工時表連結至發票，"
"以及將訂閱計劃連結至定期服務，實現流暢無縫的工作流程。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Leverage Subscriptions</strong>: Convert project clients to retainer "
"relationships using the Subscriptions app for predictable revenue."
msgstr ""
"<strong>利用訂閱計劃的潛力</strong>：使用訂閱應用程式，將專案客戶轉化為穩固關"
"係，賺取可預測的收入。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Marketing Automation</strong>: Create sophisticated nurture "
"campaigns for your own agency's lead generation."
msgstr ""
"<strong>自動化推廣</strong>：為你自己公司的潛在客戶，建立成熟、精細的培養計"
"劃。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:marketing_agency.sale_order_template_4
msgid "<strong>Not Included:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>不包括：</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Purchase</strong>: Manage freelancers and subcontractors with "
"purchase orders and vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"<strong>採購</strong>：使用採購單及供應商賬單，管理自由工作者及分包商。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Recruitment</strong>: Find and hire top creative talent with "
"applicant tracking and interview management."
msgstr ""
"<strong>招聘</strong>：透過應徵者追蹤及面試管理，網羅及聘用頂尖創意人才。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:marketing_agency.sale_order_template_4
msgid "<strong>Timeline:</strong> 6-8 weeks from project kickoff to launch"
msgstr "<strong>時間線</strong>：由專案啟動至正式發佈，需時 6 至 8 星期"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Track Profitability</strong>: Monitor project profitability by "
"comparing estimated hours to actual time spent using the Timesheets and "
"Project apps."
msgstr ""
"<strong>追蹤盈利能力</strong>：利用工時表及專案管理應用程式，比較預計工時與實"
"際所花費的工時，監察專案的盈利能力。"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Use Task Templates</strong>: Create standardized tasks for "
"repetitive work like monthly reporting, content reviews, or campaign "
"launches to ensure consistency."
msgstr ""
"<strong>使用任務範本</strong>：為重複性工作（例如每月報告、內容檢討、宣傳活動"
"啟動工作等）建立標準化任務，確保連貫一致。"

